["I need to make 24 using 8, 5, 5, 9.\n\nLet me try different combinations.\n\nNumbers: 8, 5, 5, 9\n\nLet me think...\n\n(9 - 5) * (8 - 5) = 4 * 3 = 12. No.\n\n8 * 5 = 40, 40 - 9 - 5 = 26. No.\n\n9 + 5 + 5 + 8 = 27. No.\n\n9 * 5 = 45, 45 - 8 - 5 = 32. No.\n\n(8 - 5) * 9 - 5 = 3 * 9 - 5 = 27 - 5 = 22. No.\n\n(8 - 5) * 9 + 5 = 27 + 5 = 32. No.\n\n5 * 5 = 25, 25 - 9 + 8 = 24! Yes!\n\n5 * 5 - 9 + 8 = 25 - 9 + 8 = 16 + 8 = 24. Yes!\n\nLet me verify: 5 * 5 = 25, 25 - 9 = 16, 16 + 8 = 24. \n\nSo 5 * 5 - 9 + 8 = 24.\n"]